{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/50079-sidereals-and-the-second-foundation","id":50079,"title":"Sidereals and the Second Foundation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-15T14:29:22-08:00","id":50079,"title":"Sidereals and the Second Foundation","content":"So, I've been rereading the original Foundation Trilogy recently and I've been struck again by just how similar the Second Foundation is to the Sidereals. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Foundation#The_organization\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/8f/Second_foundation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Foundation#The_organization\" target=\"_blank\"> Second Foundation - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Foundation#The_organization\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Foundation#The_organization </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_series\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d9/Foundation_-_Isaac_Asimov_%28Gnome_1951%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_series\" target=\"_blank\"> Foundation (novel series) - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_series\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_series </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> . Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T14:47:23-08:00","id":50098,"title":"","content":"Having read the Foundation books, I'll say that I got a very strong Sidereal vibe from both Hari Seldon and the Second Foundation. Specifically, their willingness to make sacrifices to ensure the survival of their master plan. Yes, the plan looks dickish in the short term and on a personal level, but it is calculated to help humanity rise from the neo-dark age as quickly as possible. Seems very much like Chejop Kejak and the Bronze faction to me. And I say this as a form of high praise to the Exalted team, since Asimov was a very skilled writer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T14:50:49-08:00","id":50103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/50079-sidereals-and-the-second-foundation?p=50098#post50098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having read the Foundation books, I'll say that I got a very strong Sidereal vibe from both Hari Seldon and the Second Foundation. Specifically, their willingness to make sacrifices to ensure the survival of their master plan. Yes, the plan looks dickish in the short term and on a personal level, but it is calculated to help humanity rise from the neo-dark age as quickly as possible. Seems very much like Chejop Kejak and the Bronze faction to me. And I say this as a form of high praise to the Exalted team, since Asimov was a very skilled writer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bel Riose confirmed for a Dynast who exalted as a Dawn Caste, and was executed for the sole crime of being inconvenient for the Galactic Bronze Faction?<br /> <br /> I'm stealing this should I ever play a Gunstar Autochthonia game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T15:37:05-08:00","id":50167,"title":"","content":"It does work very well... So,if the Second Foundation is Sidereals, is Salvor Hardin a Solar? And The Mule a Infernal who f***s up every plan on account of being out of Fate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T15:42:03-08:00","id":50171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/50079-sidereals-and-the-second-foundation?p=50167#post50167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does work very well... So,if the Second Foundation is Sidereals, is Salvor Hardin a Solar? And The Mule a Infernal who f***s up every plan on account of being out of Fate?</div> </div> </div> </div>I could see Salvor Hardin as an Eclipse Caste, yeah. The Mule... maybe a Pyrian Malefactor? That works all to well, since it would mess up Chejop Seldon's grand Fate-weaving plan something fierce.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T17:30:30-08:00","id":50279,"title":"","content":"The tale of the Second Foundation and the Mule are excellent inspiration for a Sidereal game, in fact. Not only does the interaction between Seldon's plan and the Second Foundation really match the way that Sidereals and Destiny interact (in that Destiny has narrative power and inertia itself, but may require tweaking by outside agents), the way the Second Foundation influenced the assassination of the Mule and the subsequent secret repair of the Seldon Plan really gives an idea to how Sidereal assassination works.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, the way certain people in the Foundation become aware of the Second Foundation's continued existence after the Mule's assassination is also a cool thing to use in Exalted. If you've got an astrologer good enough to divine what Destiny is for an area, or a prophecy or the like, the way things rebound back to Destiny after a major disruption can indicate Sidereal meddling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T17:36:45-08:00","id":50283,"title":"","content":"One of the bits I found especially Siderealish was the fact that they're planning to take over the new empire, once the first foundation finishes building it and that they think it will make everything perfect.<br /> <br /> I feel like there was a lot of talk like that going in to the Ursurpation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T20:07:49-08:00","id":50364,"title":"","content":"From Foundation's Edge:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wikipedia</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> Meanwhile, Trevize is made to decide between three alternatives for the future of the human race: the First Foundation's mastery of the physical world and its traditional political organization (i.e., empire), the Second Foundation's mentalics (and probable rule by mind control), or Gaia's absorption of the entire Galaxy into one shared, harmonious intellect.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>...I see what you did there, Mass Effect 3.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}